Line 1: EasyScript doesn't have "is not greater than".
    x is not greater than 5
      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Did you mean "is at most"?

Line 2: EasyScript doesn't have "isn't less than".
    x isn't less than 5
      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Did you mean "is at least"?

Line 3: EasyScript doesn't have "is not above".
    x is not above 5
      ^^^^^^^^^^^^
Did you mean "is at most"?

Line 4: "is above or equal to" isn't a comparison.
    x is above or equal to 5
      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Did you mean "is at least"?

Line 5: "< or equal to" isn't a comparison.
    x < or equal to 5
      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Did you mean "<="?

Line 6: Comparisons can't be chained like this.
    1 < x < 10
    ^^^^^^^^^^
Compare one pair at a time and join them with "and": "1 < x and x < 10".

Line 7: Comparisons can't be chained like this.
    p is q is r
    ^^^^^^^^^^^
Compare one pair at a time and join them with "and": "p is q and q is r".
